<div class="drawer" id="drawer-pollen">
  <div class="drawer-handle"></div>
  <div class="drawer-header">
    <div class="drawer-header-left">
      <div class="drawer-icon">🌸</div>
      <div>
        <div class="drawer-title">花粉</div>
        <div class="drawer-subtitle">Pollen — 季節性過敏原</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="drawer-close" onclick="closeDrawer()">✕</button>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer-body">
    <div class="drawer-lead">花粉是季節性過敏性鼻炎的主因，在花粉季節（通常春季）外出時特別需要加強防護。</div>
    <div class="drawer-section">
      <div class="drawer-section-title"><div class="drawer-section-num">1</div>外出防護</div>
      <div class="drawer-item">花粉季節外出時，務必配戴<strong>口罩</strong>（N95 或醫療口罩效果更佳）。</div>
      <div class="drawer-item">外出返家後立即<strong>洗臉、洗澡</strong>並更換衣物，避免花粉帶入室內。</div>
      <div class="drawer-item">花粉濃度高的時段（通常早上 5–10 點）盡量減少外出。</div>
    </div>
